## 8. The Path Forward

**Theorem 7: The Path Is Clear**

\[
\text{Path} = \text{Stop Colonizing}
\]

**Proof:**

| Step | Action | Why It Is Necessary |
|:---|:---|:---|
| 1 | Acknowledge | The West must admit its history |
| 2 | Witness | The West must see itself as others see it |
| 3 | Apologize | The West must ask forgiveness |
| 4 | Restore | The West must return what was taken |
| 5 | Transform | The West must change its structures |
| 6 | Witness | The West must continue to witness itself |
| 7 | Learn | The West must learn from the East |
| 8 | Stop | The West must stop colonizing |

**Corollary 7: The Path Is Long but Clear**

\[
\text{Path} \neq \text{Instant}
\]

Redemption is not a single act. It is a process. It takes time. But it is clear.

